Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.97,0:12:54.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界另一边的男人起床  继续做一模一样的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All guys from the other end of the world wake up and behave the exact same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.19,0:12:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  又进广告了  我还是没跟她说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. It's another commercial and I still haven't told her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.19,0:13:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  这是像最后一段广告  你只剩十分钟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, This is like the last commercial. Look, You've got 10 minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.65,0:13:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  你要我怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know! What am I gonna do? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.49,0:13:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不许你落跑  留她在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! You are not gonna run out and leave her here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.66,0:13:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  好啦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, all right. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:19.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.71,0:13:21.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  马上回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Joey's gonna be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.55,0:13:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,马上回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.80,0:13:27.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们顺便来聊聊你吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Meanwhile, let's-let's-let's talk about you. 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.89,0:13:30.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你年纪大  个子小\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, you're old and small.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  找到没\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.94,0:13:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耳环是没有  但我在沙发底下  找到我的太阳眼镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The earring? No. But look, I found my sunglasses under the couch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.53,0:13:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从去年夏天找到现在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been looking for these since last summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.70,0:13:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我借你的太阳眼镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Those are my sunglasses. You borrowed them from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:51.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  别激动  还你就是了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Calm down. Here they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.71,0:13:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要怎么办   我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do we do? I don't know. I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.17,0:14:02.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只好老实跟摩妮卡说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll just have to tell Monica, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老天  她一定会杀了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, God! She's gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:09.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以跟她说是我弄掉的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I suppose I could tell her it's just all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.34,0:14:10.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:15.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  我有话要跟你说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mon, could I talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.43,0:14:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. What is it? Um
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我弄丢了你一只耳环  对不起  我真的很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I lost one of your earrings. I'm sorry. I am so, so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.94,0:14:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  都弄丢了还能怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, well, I mean, what can you do? If you lost it, you lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证会赔你一副新的  我真的很愧疚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll replace it, I promise. I feel so terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.62,0:14:36.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  你又不是故意的  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's fine. You didn't do it on purpose. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.04,0:14:38.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧你难过的  来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at you. Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.79,0:14:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好点了没  有啊  你最棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You feel better? Ha, ha. Yeah. You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  等一等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一等  我不能这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute, I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.47,0:14:52.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  其实不是菲比弄丢的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen, honey, it's not Phoebe's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.05,0:14:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她把你的耳环借我  是我弄丢的  我真的很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She lent me the earrings. I lost it. I'm so sorry, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.81,0:14:59.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也觉得好愧疚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I feel terrible too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才不借给你东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is exactly why I do not lend you stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.65,0:15:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先是我的首饰  不是首饰  就是我的蓝色毛衣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay?! I mean, first it's my jewelry! And if it's not my jewelry, it's-it's my blue sweater!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.94,0:15:10.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是蓝色毛衣  就是我的太阳眼镜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And if it's not my sweater, it's my sunglasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.28,0:15:12.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的太阳眼镜  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your sunglasses? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.62,0:15:14.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.24,0:15:17.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,彼萨外送  我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pizza. Oh, mine! Mine! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.37,0:15:20.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  要开始了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, here goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备见识见识一流的打情骂俏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Prepare yourselves for some class-A flirting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.50,0:15:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:28.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我准备好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你犯不着这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, you have nothing to prove.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.63,0:15:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你真的喜欢这个女孩  我也不觉得打情骂俏是好方法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If you really like this girl, I don't think flirting is the right way
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.14,0:15:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等着看就知道  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You'll see.Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.77,0:15:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她叫什么名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, what's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.19,0:15:44.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯特琳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Caitlin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:45.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯特琳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Caitlin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.07,0:15:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.36,0:15:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吃下去也不是办法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, we can't keep eating like this. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.87,0:16:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,12块半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh. It's, uh, $12.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, um
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.79,0:16:04.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们做彼萨  是用烧木头的炉子吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you make the pizzas in one of those, uh, wood-burning ovens?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.01,0:16:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  其实是瓦斯炉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, actually, I think they're gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦斯炉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gas? Wow, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.60,0:16:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真带劲\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.23,0:16:24.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果连盖勒家的人都这样打情骂俏的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If this is the way all the Gellers flirt,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:26.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们就没有问题了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we don't have a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:32.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你知道瓦斯的味道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, uh You know that smell gas has?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.20,0:16:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.37,0:16:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是加进去的  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They put that in. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.91,0:16:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瓦斯其实是无色无味\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The gas is odorless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.46,0:16:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加上味道  是为了让人在瓦斯漏气时能闻得出来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But they add the smell so you know when there's a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.13,0:16:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多气体都有味道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A lot of other gas smells.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.98,0:17:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,救命喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, the humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.73,0:17:10.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甲烷有味道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Methane smells
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.86,0:17:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  我真的得走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? Um, actually, I really should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.15,0:17:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还没付钱呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, but I haven't paid you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:20.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  你们点了那么多  这一个算我请客\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what? That's okay. You guys have ordered so many that this one's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.21,0:17:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是跟她说到瓦斯的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Was I talking to her about gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.51,0:17:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那根本就是主题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}More so than anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.55,0:17:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得很有意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I-I-I found it interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.77,0:17:45.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很遗憾 不用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. Look, no-no, Hey, hey. 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.85,0:17:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.48,0:17:51.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,九年之后  她和我就能在一起了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In nine years, she and I will be right there! Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.07,0:18:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我去清掉这些彼萨盒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Well, I'm gonna clear out some of these boxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.29,0:18:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有哪些气体会加味道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What else do they add smell to?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.88,0:18:18.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯特琳  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Caitlin! Caitlin! Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.38,0:18:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  我是瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, I'm Rachel. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.30,0:18:22.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住楼上的  叫一堆披萨的那家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}From upstairs, people with all the pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.60,0:18:26.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  披萨有问题吗  不是  披萨很好吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, was there a problem? No. No. Every thing's--they're fine.Great pizza.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.43,0:18:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实  是我朋友罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, actually, um, my friend Ross
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他只要打情骂俏就会紧张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}he just gets really nervous when he's flirting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.94,0:18:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  他是在打情骂俏   没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! That was flirting?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.15,0:18:39.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你的感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.91,0:18:43.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过一旦过了那个阶段\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but uh just, I'm telling you,  once, once you get past that part,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.45,0:18:46.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个让你想要去死的阶段\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}where it just feels like you wanna die
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.58,0:18:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会发现  其实他是个大好人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}he's-he's really a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.62,0:18:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开口闭口都是瓦斯的那个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The guy with the gas? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:54.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给你说  他真的很体贴也风趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm-I'm telling you， he's really sweet and really funny
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.63,0:18:57.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一副好心肠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}and he's just, oh, got a good heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.34,0:19:01.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我觉得  他很喜欢你  真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And besides, I think he really likes you. Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.51,0:19:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们七个人  却叫了十个披萨  这还不够明显吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well,y'know, we have seven people and 10 pizzas. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.97,0:19:08.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想说乔伊很会吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just, I thought Joey was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.02,0:19:13.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以留到星期一  然后我会强制驱离\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You've got till Monday. Then I move to dismiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:17.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  罗斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Ross?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.49,0:19:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚才在走廊遇到凯特琳\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, I just ran into Caitlin in the hallway and-and 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你打情骂俏的技巧  肯定比我想像中更高明\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, you must be getting better at this flirting stuff than I thought. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.33,0:19:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.49,0:19:29.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我搞不懂  但她要我转交她的电话给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't get it but she wanted me to give you her phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.46,0:19:37.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她自己给你的   是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And she just gave you this? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.84,0:19:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  谢了  但我不需要你帮忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rach, thanks. But I don't need you doing me any favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.01,0:19:46.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没帮忙啊  是她觉得你很可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14} I-I-I didn't! I didn't. She thought you were cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.68,0:19:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这点我倒是相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that I can believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.56,0:19:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.19,0:19:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还在演吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is the show still on?.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快要演完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Almost over, man
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:58.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是罗马教皇吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! Is that the Pope?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.28,0:20:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我干嘛跟过去看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why am I looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.49,0:20:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿妈  来了  我的主戏上场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Nonnie, here I am! This is my big scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.45,0:20:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快退后\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.21,0:20:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有枪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got a gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,用起来可不会手软\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not afraid to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.04,0:20:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  乔伊  没错  阿妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Joey. That's right, Nonnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.84,0:20:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你起码也该换一件上衣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You couldn't have at least changed your shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.55,0:20:25.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要你在手提箱里  装满十万美元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, I want a suitcase filled with $100,000
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.72,0:20:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,装满十万美元的小钞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Filled with $100,000 in small bills.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.23,0:20:32.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,若是我没拿到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And if I don't get  Shoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.06,0:20:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,若是我没拿到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And if I don't get it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.57,0:20:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就毙了这只鸭子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna shoot this duck!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.90,0:20:41.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.57,0:20:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要出去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.25,0:20:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她会相信吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And she's supposed to buy this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.04,0:20:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.46,0:21:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地面控制队呼叫总部\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ground control to Major Tom
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.55,0:21:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,倒数开始\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Commencing countdown
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.63,0:21:07.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,动力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Engines
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.14,0:21:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,全开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}On
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.85,0:21:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是下周的片段  下周的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's, uh, scenes from next week's show. Next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一定要等着看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I am definitely gonna watch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.62,0:21:30.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一副呢  看起来一样吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What about these? Do these look the same?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.41,0:21:31.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一模一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:33.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是分开来看  那就不一样了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not as each other.Oh, then, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.29,0:21:39.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嗨  准备好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you ready? Hi. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.46,0:21:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真美\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You look amazing. Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是全世界最幸运的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm the luckiest man in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.55,0:21:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你即将要更幸运了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you're about to get a little luckier. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.47,0:21:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,耳环让我看看  喔对  耳环\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me see the earrings. Oh, right, the earrings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.97,0:21:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好看极了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.35,0:21:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你男友真是品味一流\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does your boyfriend have the best taste or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.43,0:21:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我男友的品味真的很棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My boyfriend really does have great taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.52,0:22:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,多谢你帮我选耳环\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks for picking out the earrings man.Hm-mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.11,0:22:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
